---
/**
 * Intro.astro
 * Direct port of Intro.tsx to Astro template syntax.
 * Replaces rhythm() calls with equivalent rem values (rhythm(37.5) ≈ 60rem).
 * Applies existing Intro.module.scss unchanged.
 */
import styles from './Intro.module.scss';
---
<div style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 60rem; display: flex;">
  <div class={styles.intro}>
    <h1 class="section-title">
      Keshav Worathur | <span class="detail">software engineer, ML infra</span>
    </h1>
    <p>Commercial ML research and product development is where I do my best work. I'm a proud alum of the University of Toronto (CS '25) and a current student at Georgia Tech, graduating in December.</p>
    <p>Some things I've worked on:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Built Python <strong>pre-processing pipelines</strong> that ingest 3,000+ protein structures for <a
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          href="https://gene2lead.com/"
        >
          Gene2Lead, Ltd.'s
        </a>{' '}
        drug discovery platform.</li>
      <li>
        Trained <strong>deep learning models</strong> to see and understand 3D data
        like a chemist, now deployed in production at Gene2Lead.
      </li>
      <li>
        Currently optimizing the <strong>cloud infrastructure</strong> and{' '}
        <strong>batch workflows</strong> powering{' '}
        <a
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          href="https://www.matmerize.com/"
        >
          Matmerize's
        </a>{' '}
        flagship AI tools for polymer informatics.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
